WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.736 --> 00:00:02.580
- I have something to tell you.

00:00:03.755 --> 00:00:05.848
I've been wanting to tell
you this for a long time,

00:00:05.848 --> 00:00:07.874
but I was scared,

00:00:09.631 --> 00:00:12.179
very scared about how you'd react, so...

00:00:15.263 --> 00:00:18.013
God, why is it so hard to say this?

00:00:18.013 --> 00:00:19.448
Oh yeah, I'm gay.

00:00:19.448 --> 00:00:20.477
Super gay.

00:00:20.477 --> 00:00:23.663
("Home Embrace" by Warner /
Chappell Production Music)

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:28.360
I guess I've always been
more into girls than usual.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:31.926
But it's just still really
weird for me to say that I'm,

00:00:33.279 --> 00:00:34.102
you know.

00:00:34.102 --> 00:00:34.938
Gay, gay, gay.

00:00:34.938 --> 00:00:37.017
I am so gay.

00:00:37.017 --> 00:00:39.874
No, I don't have a girlfriend.

00:00:40.982 --> 00:00:43.501
Can't even imagine having one.

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:46.485
It makes me nervous to even
think about kissing a girl.

00:00:46.485 --> 00:00:47.902
I've (bleep) Tanya, I've (bleep) Lindsay,

00:00:47.902 --> 00:00:49.225
I've (bleep) Lindsay's ex-girlfriend,

00:00:49.225 --> 00:00:51.884
I've (bleep) Shirley's
current girlfriend, drama!

00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:54.147
Mom and dad can never know, okay?

00:00:54.147 --> 00:00:57.641
My mom tried to set me up
with her neighbor's daughter.

00:00:57.641 --> 00:01:00.311
My dad's still not talking
to me, but whatever.

00:01:00.311 --> 00:01:01.369
This is who I am.

00:01:01.369 --> 00:01:02.774
He'll get over it eventually.

00:01:02.774 --> 00:01:04.026
I'll never be one of those girls

00:01:04.026 --> 00:01:07.069
who turns into a stereotypical lesbian.

00:01:07.069 --> 00:01:09.378
Did I get IPA on my favorite flannel?

00:01:09.378 --> 00:01:10.679
Hold my beannie.

00:01:10.679 --> 00:01:12.200
I can't believe I'm gay.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.116
I can't even imagine being straight.

00:01:14.116 --> 00:01:15.033
You know what?

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:17.854
I feel relieved.

00:01:17.854 --> 00:01:19.645
Like a wieght's been lifted.

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:20.899
I mean, it took some time,

00:01:20.899 --> 00:01:23.221
but now my life is pretty great.

00:01:23.221 --> 00:01:24.905
I'm happy I came out.

00:01:24.905 --> 00:01:28.812
("Home Embrace" by Warner /
Chappell Production Music)

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:33.816
I just feel like, I'm gay, you're welcome.

